+# Next staged input custody
+
+This packet contains only inputs and existing public normative premises for one ordinary local multi-condition guard. The Bool documentObserved and UInt approvedAmount are explicitly unauthenticated caller values. Three independent event tuples exercise each condition alone and their conjunction; this supplies no authenticated signature/document/proof check and accumulates no prior false observation.
+
+The root selected this bounded already-supported predicate after diagnosis found cancellation/compensation requires an unadopted pending-frame recovery transition. This is new complete public-consumer coverage, not new language semantics or closure. Cancellation diagnostic inputs and concrete alternatives remain separate under the source proposal, unfrozen as a cancellation oracle.
+
+No test assertions, expected Program/Plan/report/effects/work or generated producer data are included. A fresh independent custodian derives and freezes complete expectations before test-source consumption or execution. Original14 gaps and all U0-U7/M1-M17/MC/SP/G/full-finance/composition exits remain open. Existing normative examples are source-exposed; this packet does not claim blinding. All product/runtime checks remain unrun.
